# No "local-first" branding

Never call Olive Studio **local-first**, **Local First**, or **Local-First** in UI copy, docs, READMEs, release notes, comments aimed at users, commit messages, or PR text.

## Prefer

- "local GUI" / "runs on your machine"
- "no cloud account required for recipe building and local execution"
- For security/middleware: "loopback-only" or "local-only" (not "local-first")

## Examples

| Avoid | Use |
|-------|-----|
| Local-first GUI for Microsoft Olive | Local GUI for Microsoft Olive |
| local-first threat model | loopback / local deployment threat model |
| Generated by Olive Studio — local-first … | Generated by Olive Studio |

When editing existing copy that says local-first, replace it with one of the preferred phrasings above.
